{"screen_name": "Fujinagi", "file": "Fujinagi", "name": "藤凪/FUJINAGI", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1947290212780171264/4KweG744.jpg", "header_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/1701760417/1725435176/1500x500", "description": "illustrator　藤凪(FUJINAGI)　Commission OK！日本/EN\n【Portfolio】→https://www.foriio.com/fujinagi\n【skeb】→https://skeb.jp/@Fujinagi", "total_works": 18, "scraped_works": 18, "first_seen": "2026-02-18T05:11:40.530691+00:00", "last_updated": "2026-02-18T05:11:40.530691+00:00", "price_history": {"art": [{"amount": 8000, "recorded_at": "2026-02-18T05:11:40.530691+00:00"}]}, "current_prices": {"art": 8000}, "price_range": {"art": {"min": 8000, "max": 8000}}, "links": [{"label": "Twitter", "url": "https://x.com/Fujinagi093", "name": "Fujinagi093"}, {"label": "Misskey_io", "url": "https://misskey.io/@Fujinagi093", "name": "Fujinagi093"}, {"label": "Website", "url": "https://www.foriio.com/fujinagi", "name": ""}], "flags": {}, "works": [{"path": "/@Fujinagi/works/18", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/df5cbe2b/uploads/origins/7e33628c-7b77-47c0-ade3-fbda56682a7d?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=da0d41299b44cbec0e0ad2d032d8c887", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/df5cbe2b/uploads/origins/7e33628c-7b77-47c0-ade3-fbda56682a7d?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=da0d41299b44cbec0e0ad2d032d8c887, https://si.imgix.net/df5cbe2b/uploads/origins/7e33628c-7b77-47c0-ade3-fbda56682a7d?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=8f1df486554f12ebc27128f7e9972cad 2x, https://si.imgix.net/df5cbe2b/uploads/origins/7e33628c-7b77-47c0-ade3-fbda56682a7d?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=78c084b43c716dd56c922d12cf60c8ce 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "こんにちは、藤凪さん。いつも素敵なイラストをありがとうございます！私のキャラクター＜グリード＞のイラストをリクエストしてもよろしいでしょうか？\n\nhttps://toyhou.se/32794094.oc-refs/33620594.greed/gallery?key=Q0Q46hKDA4y5FuX\n\nURLからお好きな衣装をお選びください。グリードとは、不思議で愛想の良い性格の魔物で、魔法の骨董屋を営んでいる。\n\nミステリアスな雰囲気で描いてもらえると嬉しいです。モルフォ蝶を持っていたり、赤いリンゴを持っていたり。あとは藤凪さんにお任せします。\n\n可能であれば、看板レイヤーをイラストとは別にしたPSDファイルを納品してください。何卒よろしくお願いいたします。", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@Fujinagi/works/17", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/8e838a30/uploads/origins/5b876023-ec7c-4d4b-9518-80fb385d3ae0?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=151aa929c31715d0d26883a5d43f3dee", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/8e838a30/uploads/origins/5b876023-ec7c-4d4b-9518-80fb385d3ae0?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=151aa929c31715d0d26883a5d43f3dee, https://si.imgix.net/8e838a30/uploads/origins/5b876023-ec7c-4d4b-9518-80fb385d3ae0?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=23ad39843e1758ab74ee5f4dc3d485f2 2x, https://si.imgix.net/8e838a30/uploads/origins/5b876023-ec7c-4d4b-9518-80fb385d3ae0?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=0c26ae9f4c3bbc428bd8e039b5a371de 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "Hello again! The last work was simply exquisite, thank you again! I'm here with another request!\n\nsta.sh/0j5vxwhssn7\n\nAn eldritch creature that likes humans. She was born and Earth and was raised in isolation, but grew curious of the culture of the planet. Unable to directly interact with people, she grew attached to the web, as it let her consume human culture and talk with them through text. Wanting to further interact, she made a doll for himself, and started her own website to share all the knowledge she had accumulated to interact more with humans. It has a 90's aesthetic and grainy footage.\n\nDraw her however you want! She can't express because of her doll face, unfortunately, but she can still emote with her LED face-mask. I'd like her mask on because of that, and I leave everything else for you to decide. You can have her with her sleeves rolled up or left down, with her hood up or down, her spider legs out or not, it's totally up to you! I leave the scene and composition up to you. The kind of vibe I want is a beneficiary scholar eager to assist, but isn't aware just how terrifying they are.\n\nIf possible, please deliver a PSD file with the sign layer separate from the illustration. Thank you for your consideration, and have a lovely day!", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@Fujinagi/works/16", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/d3fd5823/uploads/origins/483d6fd0-646c-4803-8339-103666441842?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=dfe3942a268cff9a5491b32a8ab662bb", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/d3fd5823/uploads/origins/483d6fd0-646c-4803-8339-103666441842?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=dfe3942a268cff9a5491b32a8ab662bb, https://si.imgix.net/d3fd5823/uploads/origins/483d6fd0-646c-4803-8339-103666441842?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=e2da88045bb043177df1251b9a2e6cf3 2x, https://si.imgix.net/d3fd5823/uploads/origins/483d6fd0-646c-4803-8339-103666441842?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=5846a42e5a3d0397bc1c54efde968fe0 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": true, "body": "こんにちは！あなたのアートスタイルはとてもクールですね！血のアートワークもとても好きです。\n\n私のキャラクターの絵をお願いしたいです：\n名前はサッカリン、かわいいヤンデレです。\n年齢は18歳で高校生です。\n背は低くて華奢だけど、体は強い。\n目は大きくて、緑色だけど、暗くて、キラキラした光は入っていない。眼鏡は大きくて丸い。\n髪は後ろの毛先をカールさせている。\n服装は制服。\n\nナイフ🔪や斧🪓、ラブレター💌などの小道具を追加することもできます。ポーズや背景・構図は自由に決めてください。顔の血飛沫も入れてください！\n\n必要であれば、下のリンクにグーグルドライブのリンクと一緒にもっと写真があります：\nhttps://toyhou.se/1332053.saccharin/gallery\n\nご検討ありがとうございます！楽しく描いていただけると嬉しいです^^💕。\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1_9qOIbZxM8NhETsy1gdXhG4DVA2eVBH5", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@Fujinagi/works/15", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/28d5e636/uploads/origins/0806df51-6141-4305-8067-9c2e4896b03f?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=755d5cf4964b82c437d35fa3e4cff951", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/28d5e636/uploads/origins/0806df51-6141-4305-8067-9c2e4896b03f?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=755d5cf4964b82c437d35fa3e4cff951, https://si.imgix.net/28d5e636/uploads/origins/0806df51-6141-4305-8067-9c2e4896b03f?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=b9ee806d6d3be24ac3b13d40d5609e24 2x, https://si.imgix.net/28d5e636/uploads/origins/0806df51-6141-4305-8067-9c2e4896b03f?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=d50554ebcc776d8da8e0afc7f55c09df 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "Hello again! Thank you for the last piece, it was wonderful! I'd like to make another request!\n\nsta.sh/0f2cotcfa6h\n\nA young dragon with a mysterious view. He had a troubled childhood, and after learning the dark truth of the world, tried to take his own life. He was saved by his imaginary friend, an experience that changed him. Now he's a sociable kind person who enjoys helping others, if more than a little deranged. If you ask him about the \"dark truth,\" he'll smile and tell you \"the readers\" are watching.\n\nAs always, your expression are exquisite and tell so much! I would prefer him without make-up to fully capture the essence of your wonderful faces. I think a kind of deranged yet smiling/happy expression would be good, but I leave it and the scene up to you!\n\nThank you for your consideration!", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@Fujinagi/works/14", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/9f23dd1b/uploads/origins/e4a27102-f1e7-4aa1-b03e-bfd660f3ef7f?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=530ccfca7083456ce83789bbf0592214", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/9f23dd1b/uploads/origins/e4a27102-f1e7-4aa1-b03e-bfd660f3ef7f?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=530ccfca7083456ce83789bbf0592214, https://si.imgix.net/9f23dd1b/uploads/origins/e4a27102-f1e7-4aa1-b03e-bfd660f3ef7f?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=d5c0a7c8a47ea5416b628faa3964a461 2x, https://si.imgix.net/9f23dd1b/uploads/origins/e4a27102-f1e7-4aa1-b03e-bfd660f3ef7f?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=42b5d5df2dbaf36c30acf52b4add645a 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "Hello again! Your atmospheric art and the way you draw men is the best, so I'd like to make another request!\n\nsta.sh/011msbp6gy17\n\nHe's a plague doctor who works for the mob. He takes his work seriously, and outside work he's considered a different person. Dull and boring, his attempts to be sociable tend to fail since people lose interest in him the more he talks. He's surprised to learn this, since he considers himself a fun person.\n\nI like your lovely expressions, so I'd prefer the mask off, but you can have it in his hands or somewhere else if you'd like. I'd also like for there to be some blood splatter on his face, and other than that I leave the rest to you.\n\nThank you for your consideration!", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@Fujinagi/works/13", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/ea088e4d/uploads/origins/0ed9c25e-7c1a-46ea-bd72-12b9bcdaac59?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=24b705f985b620ceab10822297e4fe29", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/ea088e4d/uploads/origins/0ed9c25e-7c1a-46ea-bd72-12b9bcdaac59?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=24b705f985b620ceab10822297e4fe29, https://si.imgix.net/ea088e4d/uploads/origins/0ed9c25e-7c1a-46ea-bd72-12b9bcdaac59?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=3b305f0034749b495f9da5d8858ad439 2x, https://si.imgix.net/ea088e4d/uploads/origins/0ed9c25e-7c1a-46ea-bd72-12b9bcdaac59?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=d4a3c79e1c42726f602236b3cd31529b 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "こんにちは！あなたの絵のムーディーさがとても好きです。\n\n私のVtuberモデル、Atya Tepesの絵を描いてもらいたいわ。\n\nAtyaはヴァンパイアシュリンプです。彼女の牙、触角、そして爪のある手に注目してください。彼女を自由に描いてください。あなたがどんな絵を描くか、興味津々です。\n\n本当にありがとうございました！\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1wh4nb9Prf-xxPuPSdYPfuSSxNEoH5bfq", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@Fujinagi/works/12", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/ad466b7b/uploads/origins/bb270d90-e31d-43ee-8ba6-ea4b0976598b?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=b7c6a9f393b3aba68ff4ea17d123ea64", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/ad466b7b/uploads/origins/bb270d90-e31d-43ee-8ba6-ea4b0976598b?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=b7c6a9f393b3aba68ff4ea17d123ea64, https://si.imgix.net/ad466b7b/uploads/origins/bb270d90-e31d-43ee-8ba6-ea4b0976598b?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=d63f433e71e239f409f61c07463ffd1e 2x, https://si.imgix.net/ad466b7b/uploads/origins/bb270d90-e31d-43ee-8ba6-ea4b0976598b?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=ef257eeab87b265f0dae6fe4e21267db 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "はじめまして、藤凪様。\n個人でVtuber活動をしております丑飼ナガレと申します。\n\n藤凪様の美麗すぎるイラストの数々に惹かれましてリクエスト送らせて頂きました。\n特に色彩の煌びやかさと、瞳の力強さが好きすぎます…！\n\nもし、もしよろしければ、丑飼ナガレのイラストを描いて頂けたらと思います。\n断っていただいても大丈夫です！\nバストアップで頭や肩が切れていないと助かります。\n構図や表情はお任せ致します！\n\nそして可能でしたらyoutubeのサムネイルに使用したいと思っております。\n誠に勝手ながら、使用許可と透過済のイラストも頂けると助かります。\nお忙しいところ恐縮ですがぜひご検討宜しくお願いします。\n\n丑飼ナガレ\n\n三面図は資料URLに貼らせて頂きました。\n見づらくてスイマセン…衣装は自分で作成して構造的に変なところもありますので雰囲気で描いていただいて構わないです。本当にすいません。\n\nhttps://x.com/Ushikai_V_N/status/1674802517186863107", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@Fujinagi/works/11", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/05ab33be/uploads/origins/edb131e9-3fd3-4ffc-8758-3c8f3477f512?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=6a4714e09e503dcb46ed0823f5b4dc6a", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/05ab33be/uploads/origins/edb131e9-3fd3-4ffc-8758-3c8f3477f512?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=6a4714e09e503dcb46ed0823f5b4dc6a, https://si.imgix.net/05ab33be/uploads/origins/edb131e9-3fd3-4ffc-8758-3c8f3477f512?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=20a8542ba19171a60cd554a633bebb86 2x, https://si.imgix.net/05ab33be/uploads/origins/edb131e9-3fd3-4ffc-8758-3c8f3477f512?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=50ec81eaed83eea7d09f746912e27981 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "あなたのアートワークが大好きです。僕のキャラクターのアートワークを依頼したいんだ。彼の顔はスクリーンに近く、目が赤く光り、顔には赤く光る血がついています。少し下を向いています。口にも指を入れています。ライティングは、赤を際立たせるために暗くてムーディーなものにします！\n\n参考ポーズはこちら - https://drive.google.com/file/d/1z7sJwMQ3HfYDPJ61UEuF90HisdcZLEX6/view?usp=sharing\n\nこれが私のキャラクターです - https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1OKbK1GMNWCSUgI2dJhgWVTzjK_A9quZJ?usp=sharing\n\nありがとう！", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@Fujinagi/works/10", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/d39cc6db/uploads/origins/e3d7d5ea-bb32-42e2-a50f-884ac00ffcdb?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=9ab5f3bf6077e920965f047060570d86", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/d39cc6db/uploads/origins/e3d7d5ea-bb32-42e2-a50f-884ac00ffcdb?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=9ab5f3bf6077e920965f047060570d86, https://si.imgix.net/d39cc6db/uploads/origins/e3d7d5ea-bb32-42e2-a50f-884ac00ffcdb?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=40f8a733c5f25dc5b80eb62cc0d6ad55 2x, https://si.imgix.net/d39cc6db/uploads/origins/e3d7d5ea-bb32-42e2-a50f-884ac00ffcdb?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=b92aa1f5e74999bdebf86fd1b7ac1ae4 3x", "genre": "art